Requirements

- Python 3.11
- Recommended: Create a virtual environment
  (e.g. venv: https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html,
  conda: https://conda.io/projects/conda/en/latest/user-guide/tasks/manage-environments.html)
- Install the package: https://pypi.org/project/besser-agentic-framework/

    pip install besser-agentic-framework[all]
{% if classical_ic_fallback %}

This agent has no intent classifier set and no LLM configured, so it matches
intents with BAF's classical intent classifier, which needs PyTorch. The [all]
extra installs it; for a smaller install use:

    pip install besser-agentic-framework[extras,llms,torch]
{% endif %}

To start the agent, run:
    python {{agent.name}}.py

In case your agent uses an LLM, you will need to configure the LLM credentials in the config.yaml file.

Check out the official BAF repository and documentation for detailed information: 
https://github.com/BESSER-PEARL/BESSER-Agentic-Framework

